WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.324
Today is the final check. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:07.164
Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:07.614 --> 00:00:09.014
There are three parts again.

4
00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:10.587
Do not help today.

5
00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:17.476
Part B matters most. Your child has never seen these sentences, so memory of a page cannot help.

6
00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:24.923
Part C is four new words. They work like words your child has mapped. It shows whether the mapping is being used.

7
00:00:25.373 --> 00:00:29.802
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

8
00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:34.449
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

9
00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:42.430
If the numbers have not moved, that is not a failure. Your page says how to slow the plan down, and when to tell the teacher.

10
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.549
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
